        "subtitle.descr": "The subtitle in the report header. The default value is Prepared by Business Analyst Pro.",
        "subtitle.title": "Report Subtitle",
        "summarization_options.descr": "<xdoc><p>Specifies how the data will be displayed in a report.</p><ul><li><span title=\"INDIVIDUAL_FEATURES\">Individual features</span>—Selected report templates will be returned for each individual trade area polygon. This is the default.</li><li><span title=\"WHOLE_LAYER\">For the whole layer</span>—Selected report templates will be returned representing only the full extent of the trade area.</li><li><span title=\"BOTH_FEATURES_AND_LAYER\">For both individual features and the whole layer</span>—Selected report templates will be returned for both individual features and the whole layer.</li></ul></xdoc>",
